      "nonWhitePixels": 21512,
      "renderedText": "8. 单选\n\n旅行者从 \n𝐴\nA 到 \n𝐵\nB，以正速度 \n𝑣\n1\nv\n1\n\t​\n\n 走一半路程、以正速度 \n𝑣\n2\nv\n2\n\t​\n\n 走另一半，且 \n𝑣\n1\n≠\n𝑣\n2\nv\n1\n\t​\n\n\n=v\n2\n\t​\n\n。返回时，以 \n𝑣\n1\nv\n1\n\t​\n\n 走返回总时间的一半，以 \n𝑣\n2\nv\n2\n\t​\n\n 走另一半。记全程距离为 \n𝐷\n>\n0\nD>0。哪条推理正确判断哪一方向耗时更多？\nA\n去程 \n𝑇\n去\n=\n𝐷\n2\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝐷\n2\n𝑣\n2\nT\n去\n\t​\n\n=\n2v\n1\n\t​\n\nD\n\t​\n\n+\n2v\n2\n\t​\n\nD\n\t​\n\n，回程 \n𝑇\n回\n=\n2\n𝐷\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝑣\n2\nT\n回\n\t​\n\n=\nv\n1\n\t​\n\n+v\n2\n\t​\n\n2D\n\t​\n\n。两者之差为 \n𝐷\n(\n𝑣\n1\n−\n𝑣\n2\n)\n2\n2\n𝑣\n1\n𝑣\n2\n(\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝑣\n2\n)\n>\n0\n2v\n1\n\t​\n\nv\n2\n\t​\n\n(v\n1\n\t​\n\n+v\n2\n\t​\n\n)\nD(v\n1\n\t​\n\n−v\n2\n\t​\n\n)\n2\n\t​\n\n>0，所以去程耗时更多。\nB\n去程 \n𝑇\n去\n=\n2\n𝐷\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝑣\n2\nT\n去\n\t​\n\n=\nv\n1\n\t​\n\n+v\n2\n\t​\n\n2D\n\t​\n\n，回程 \n𝑇\n回\n=\n𝐷\n2\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝐷\n2\n𝑣\n2\nT\n回\n\t​\n\n=\n2v\n1\n\t​\n\nD\n\t​\n\n+\n2v\n2\n\t​\n\nD\n\t​\n\n。两者之差为 \n𝐷\n(\n𝑣\n1\n−\n𝑣\n2\n)\n2\n2\n𝑣\n1\n𝑣\n2\n(\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝑣\n2\n)\n>\n0\n2v\n1\n\t​\n\nv\n2\n\t​\n\n(v\n1\n\t​\n\n+v\n2\n\t​\n\n)\nD(v\n1\n\t​\n\n−v\n2\n\t​\n\n)\n2\n\t​\n\n>0，所以去程耗时更多。\nC\n去程和回程平均速度都是 \n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝑣\n2\n2\n2\nv\n1\n\t​\n\n+v\n2\n\t​\n\n\t​\n\n，但 \n𝑣\n1\n≠\n𝑣\n2\nv\n1\n\t​\n\n\n=v\n2\n\t​\n\n，所以去程耗时更多。\nD\n去程 \n𝑇\n去\n=\n𝐷\n2\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝐷\n2\n𝑣\n2\nT\n去\n\t​\n\n=\n2v\n1\n\t​\n\nD\n\t​\n\n+\n2v\n2\n\t​\n\nD\n\t​\n\n，回程 \n𝑇\n回\n=\n2\n𝐷\n𝑣\n1\n+\n𝑣\n2\nT\n回\n\t​\n\n=\nv\n1\n\t​\n\n+v\n2\n\t​\n\n2D\n\t​\n\n。两者之差为 \n𝐷\n(\n𝑣\n1\n−\n𝑣\n2\n)\n2\n𝑣\n1\n𝑣\n2\n>\n0\n2v\n1\n\t​\n\nv\n2\n\t​\n\nD(v\n1\n\t​\n\n−v\n2\n\t​\n\n)\n\t​\n\n>0，所以去程耗时更多。",
